                "content": "### Brought to you by\n\n[![Cybertec – The PostgreSQL Database Company](https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/cybertec-postgresql/pgwatch@master/docs/gallery/cybertec-logo-white-blue.svg)](https://www.cybertec-postgresql.com/en/)\n",
                "mode": "markdown"
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {},
                "overrides": []
